{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "拦在每一步",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 92.2,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "这些骗局有一个共同点。",
   "spoken": "这些骗局有一个共同点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 1.699,
   "speechEnd": 3.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "攻击者控制不了你的私钥，也控制不了链上合约的逻辑。",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制不了你的私钥，也控制不了链上合约的逻辑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 3.74,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 3.74,
   "speechEnd": 7.933
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "每一步都要你的一个动作，点击、签名、复制、粘贴。",
   "spoken": "每一步都要你的一个动作，点击、签名、复制、粘贴。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 8.36,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 8.454,
   "speechEnd": 13.201
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "每一个动作，都是一个可以拦截的点。",
   "spoken": "每一个动作，都是一个可以拦截的点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 13.62,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 13.714,
   "speechEnd": 16.351
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "钱包这一层，先把签名请求解码成看得懂的字段。",
   "spoken": "钱包这一层，先把签名请求解码成看得懂的字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 16.8,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 16.895,
   "speechEnd": 21.212
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "授权给谁，额度多少，期限到哪天，委托哪个合约。",
   "spoken": "授权给谁，额度多少，期限到哪天，委托哪个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 21.66,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 21.66,
   "speechEnd": 26.421
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "无法解码，就明确显示无法解析。",
   "spoken": "无法解码，就明确显示无法解析。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 26.84,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 26.932,
   "speechEnd": 29.699
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "无限授权、批量授权、7702 委托，默认强警告。",
   "spoken": "无限授权、批亮授权、7702 委托，默认强警告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 30.1,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 30.198,
   "speechEnd": 35.331
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "7702 委托，只允许指向钱包自己审计过的实现合约，拒绝网站发起的委托请求。",
   "spoken": "7702 委托，只允许指向钱包自己审计过的实现合约，拒绝网站发起的委托请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 35.76,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 35.76,
   "speechEnd": 43.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "交易模拟，在签名之前，显示签完以后余额怎么变。",
   "spoken": "交易模拟，在签名之前，显示签完以后余额怎么变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 44.14,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 44.14,
   "speechEnd": 48.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "新注册的域名、仿冒的域名，直接拦下。",
   "spoken": "新注册的域名、仿冒的域名，直接拦下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 49.32,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 49.32,
   "speechEnd": 53.037
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "DApp 只请求精确额度的授权，用完就停。",
   "spoken": "DApp 只请求精确额度的授权，用完就停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 53.46,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 53.553,
   "speechEnd": 57.091
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "交易所这一层，提币地址用白名单，新地址有冷却期。",
   "spoken": "交易所这一层，提币地址用白名单，新地址有冷却期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 57.52,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 57.52,
   "speechEnd": 62.229
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "新地址和历史地址首尾相同、中间不同，就强提示。",
   "spoken": "新地址和历史地址首尾相同、中间不同，就强提示。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 62.62,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 62.62,
   "speechEnd": 67.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "交易记录默认折叠零额转账和陌生代币。",
   "spoken": "交易记录默认折叠零额转账和陌生代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 67.8,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 67.894,
   "speechEnd": 71.404
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "充值只认白名单里的代币合约，假 USDT 不入账。",
   "spoken": "充值只认白名单里的代币合约，假 USDT 不入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 71.78,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 71.78,
   "speechEnd": 76.147
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "上币前，检查卖出限制、持仓集中度和增发权限。",
   "spoken": "上币前，检查卖出限制、持仓集中度和增发权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 76.56,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 76.56,
   "speechEnd": 81.367
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "已知的 Drainer 收款地址和投毒地址，进风控名单。",
   "spoken": "已知的 Drainer 收款地址和投毒地址，进风控名单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 81.82,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 81.918,
   "speechEnd": 85.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "提币页和空投活动页，提示官方从不要求签名领取。",
   "spoken": "提币页和空投活动页，提示官方从不要求签名领取。",
